>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我正在学习英文戏剧。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/825965\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">円周</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">圆周</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">练习；训练；演练；军事演习；军事演练；演习；研讨班；研讨课</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演出</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんしゅつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（戏剧、电影等的）导演；制作；（活动等的）组织；安排；舞台效果编排；统筹</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211153\">その<ruby>劇<rp>(</rp><rt>げき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によって<ruby>演出<rp>(</rp><rt>えんしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">剧本是他制作的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">エンジニア</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=