" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">发动机；引擎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213332\">そのエンジンは<ruby>蒸気<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>動<rp>(</rp><rt>うご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">引擎是蒸汽驱动的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演ずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">扮演（角色）；饰演；演出（戏剧等）；上演；犯（失误）；装作；出丑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110309\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はロミオを<ruby>演<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずるとプログラムに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">节目里说他在演罗密欧</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿線</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沿线；铁路沿线；公路沿线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演説</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんぜつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">演讲；演说</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95140\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>演説<rp>(</rp><rt>えんぜつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすばらしかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她的演讲很精彩</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演奏</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">演奏</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188770\"><ruby>演奏<rp>(</rp><rt>えんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりかけていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">演出快结束了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠足</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">学校郊游；野外考察；远足旅行；长途步行；徒步游览</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140780\"><ruby>全体<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として、<ruby>遠足<rp>(</rp><rt>えんそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">总的来说,游览是愉快的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁談</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">婚事；婚谈；提亲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">延長</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">延长；拉长；延伸；延长；（总）长度；延续；继续；延伸（如工作的延伸）；线段的延长线；广延性